<p>The fastest way to slow down a job is quoting from an old spec book. This is the one-page reference for where current W.W. Wood Products literature lives, how your team gets into the Portal, and how to get printed brochures for the showroom.</p>

<h2>The W.W. Wood Portal</h2>

<div class="post-figure">
  <img src="/images/blog/ww-wood-dealer-resources-portal/ww-wood-portal.webp" alt="Screenshot of the W.W. Wood Products dealer Portal" width="1547" height="429" fetchpriority="high" />
</div>

<p>In the <a href="https://my.wwinc.com/account/login" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Portal</a> you can:</p>

<ul>
  <li>Check <strong>order status</strong></li>
  <li><strong>Upload new orders</strong></li>
  <li><strong>Request a warranty</strong></li>
  <li><strong>Download the most recent spec books and catalogs</strong></li>
  <li><strong>Manage billing</strong></li>
</ul>

<h3>Getting your team access</h3>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Each dealer has a Portal Administrator</strong> who can create and manage user accounts for the rest of the team. If a new designer needs access, start with your administrator.</li>
  <li><strong>No account yet, or can't log in?</strong> Email <a href="mailto:SignUp@wwinc.com">SignUp@wwinc.com</a> for help.</li>
</ul>

