<h2>New Shiloh brochure</h2>

<div class="post-figure">
  <img src="/images/blog/ww-wood-dealer-resources-portal/shiloh-brochure-v41-cover.webp" alt="Cover of the updated Shiloh Cabinetry brochure, version 41" width="900" height="1165" loading="lazy" />
</div>

<p>Shiloh Cabinetry released an updated brochure — a good tool for walking clients through everything Shiloh offers in a design consultation. Two ways to get it:</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Printed copies for the showroom:</strong> email a completed <strong>Shiloh Standard Order Form</strong> requesting brochures to your Pinnacle Sales rep.</li>
  <li><strong>Digital:</strong> download it any time from the <a href="https://my.wwinc.com/portal/resources" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Portal resources page</a> to share before the next client meeting.</li>
</ul>

<h2>How lead times are counted</h2>

<p>W.W. Wood's posted lead time has been <strong>5–6 weeks</strong> in every 2026 update (most recently August 31, 2026), with orders <strong>typically delivered in the sixth week</strong>. Two things matter:</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>The clock starts once the order is acknowledged</strong> — not when you send it.</li>
  <li><strong>Clean orders move faster.</strong> Orders that need minimal clarification or intervention from customer service are acknowledged and processed much more quickly. If you want a second set of eyes before submitting, use our <a href="/dealer-hub/submit/?type=order-check">order check</a>.</li>
</ul>

<p>Lead times change — always confirm the current figure with your rep or customer service for a time-sensitive job.</p>

<h2>Share your work</h2>

<p>Our newsletter's Design Showcase features dealer kitchens built with W.W. Wood products — like the <a href="/playbook/elevated-spaces-shiloh-inset-kitchen/">Elevated Spaces Shiloh kitchen</a>. If you have a finished project you're proud of, send photos to your Pinnacle Sales rep and we'll consider it for a future issue and the Playbook.</p>

<h2>Questions</h2>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Pinnacle Sales</strong> — for literature or marketing assets, use <a href="/dealer-hub/submit/?type=marketing-assets">Submit a Request</a>.</li>
  <li><strong>W.W. Wood Products customer service</strong> — <a href="tel:5736243526">573-624-3526</a> or <a href="mailto:customer.service@wwinc.com">customer.service@wwinc.com</a>.</li>
</ul>

